    "name": "SURVEILLANCE DUTY: Twisted Sight",
    "steam_appid": 3771770,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/e3c62fc1de2f608061ff06fda23f8206.avif?t=1751392617\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have been assigned to a round-the-clock monitoring post.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your task</strong> is to watch the installed cameras and immediately log any anomalies: changes in the environment, image distortions, the appearance of unauthorized objects or entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every discrepancy</strong> must be recorded through the reporting interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ignoring deviations</strong> will allow them to accumulate and spiral out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember:</strong> you must not leave your post without permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doubts about the reality of what you observe do not free you from responsibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1a514470cf334c3323562c14e75e31bd.poster.avif?t=1751392617\" width=670 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1a514470cf334c3323562c14e75e31bd.webm?t=1751392617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1a514470cf334c3323562c14e75e31bd.mp4?t=1751392617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/faf2fd6df0d15aac57f2f7dc54a2c110.avif?t=1751392617\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will not be alone.</strong> Dr. Amalia\u2014your personal curator and overseer\u2014will be watching your work.<br><strong>She will help you master</strong> the surveillance system, give recommendations, and remind you of what matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1b56961366f474c0f0ea2ad28ee8d377.poster.avif?t=1751392617\" width=670 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1b56961366f474c0f0ea2ad28ee8d377.webm?t=1751392617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1b56961366f474c0f0ea2ad28ee8d377.mp4?t=1751392617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/8badbfb0e310ab89971903953bac220d.avif?t=1751392617\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You may notice</strong> visual distortions, signal dropouts, or interference on the screens. This is normal.<br><strong>Try not to lose focus.</strong> Some anomalies disguise themselves as technical malfunctions.<br>If the image looks \u201cwrong,\u201d it needs to be logged.<br><strong>Do not attempt</strong> to adjust the equipment yourself.<br>Stay at your station. Keep watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/19febbb2e3f2d74be74e8df4caa5f3c0.poster.avif?t=1751392617\" width=670 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/19febbb2e3f2d74be74e8df4caa5f3c0.webm?t=1751392617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/19febbb2e3f2d74be74e8df4caa5f3c0.mp4?t=1751392617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/e3c62fc1de2f608061ff06fda23f8206.avif?t=1751392617\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official reports</strong> do not explain what exactly happened.<br>The recordings cut off abruptly, the signal vanished, and the operator never re-established contact.<br><strong>The room remains locked from the inside.</strong> No signs of struggle, no bodies.<br>Now you are here. In front of the same screens. With the same task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch closely.</strong> Miss nothing.<br>And try not to follow in their footsteps.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/e3c62fc1de2f608061ff06fda23f8206.avif?t=1751392617\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have been assigned to a round-the-clock monitoring post.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your task</strong> is to watch the installed cameras and immediately log any anomalies: changes in the environment, image distortions, the appearance of unauthorized objects or entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every discrepancy</strong> must be recorded through the reporting interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ignoring deviations</strong> will allow them to accumulate and spiral out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember:</strong> you must not leave your post without permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doubts about the reality of what you observe do not free you from responsibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1a514470cf334c3323562c14e75e31bd.poster.avif?t=1751392617\" width=670 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1a514470cf334c3323562c14e75e31bd.webm?t=1751392617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/1a514470cf334c3323562c14e75e31bd.mp4?t=1751392617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771770/extras/faf2fd6df0d15aac57f2f7dc54a2c110.avif?t=1751392617\" width=670 height=50 /></span></p><p cla